        },
        {
          "name": "Message",
          "type": "TCHAR*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Verbosity",
          "type": "ELogVerbosity::Type"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Logs an a message to the provided log channel. If a callstack is included (detected by lines starting with 0x) if will be logged in the standard Unreal\nformat of [Callstack] Address FunctionInfo [File]\n@param\tLogName\t\tLog channel. If NAME_None then LowLevelOutputDebugStringf is used\n@param\tFile\t\tFile name ANSI string (__FILE__)\n@param\tLine\t\tLine number (__LINE__)\n@param\tHeading\t\tInformative heading displayed above the message callstack\n@param\tMessage\t\tMulti-line message with a callstack"
    },
